"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_models.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:18
msgid ""
"`compute_run_id` hashes a composite of taxpayer ID, model, period "
"identity, and start time, then keeps a 16-character lowercase hexadecimal"
" prefix. That avoids placing the tax ID directly in the identifier, while"
" the input composition makes IDs deterministic for the same run facts. "
"run_models.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_models.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`compute_run_id` calcula un hash de una combinación de identificador del "
"contribuyente, modelo, identidad del período y hora de inicio y conserva "
"un prefijo hexadecimal en minúsculas de 16 caracteres. Eso evita colocar "
"el identificador fiscal directamente en el identificador, mientras que la"
" composición de entradas hace que los identificadores sean deterministas "
"para los mismos hechos de ejecución. run_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_models.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:20
msgid ""
"`run_projection.py` is a serialization boundary for read results. It "
"snapshots obligations, typed step details, site-health facts, and a "
"terminal run; reconstruction routes detail variants through Pydantic "
"adapters so model-specific constraints are rechecked. It projects only "
"the terminal step, verifies terminal/abort consistency, and checks that "
"summary period, obligation period, and alert run ID agree. This reduces "
"the chance that a persisted canonical record is flattened into an "
"unchecked or inconsistent public shape. run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`run_projection.py` es un límite de serialización para resultados de "
"lectura. Captura instantáneas de obligaciones, detalles tipados de pasos,"
" hechos de salud del sitio y una ejecución final; la reconstrucción pasa "
"las variantes de detalles por adaptadores Pydantic para volver a "
"comprobar las restricciones específicas de cada modelo. Proyecta solo el "
"paso final, verifica la coherencia final y de aborto y comprueba que "
"coincidan período del resumen, período de obligación e identificador de "
"ejecución de la alerta. Esto reduce la posibilidad de aplanar un registro"
" canónico persistido en una estructura pública incoherente o sin "
"comprobar. run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`) run_projection.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_projection.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:22
msgid "Run-history operations and profile boundary"
msgstr "Operaciones de historial de ejecuciones y límite del perfil"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:24
msgid ""
"The application exposes two read operations: exact-run lookup and run "
"inventory. Requests are credential-free but require a profile UUID; exact"
" lookup validates the 16-character run ID and can carry an expected "
"period. Executors receive explicit profile-bound ports, verify the "
"requested profile matches both operation context and factory result, load"
" by exact run ID, and check stored identity and period consistency before"
" projecting. The list path validates each canonical record before "
"creating a public inventory projection. run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`) "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La aplicación expone dos operaciones de lectura: búsqueda de ejecución "
"exacta e inventario de ejecuciones. Las solicitudes no contienen "
"credenciales, pero exigen un UUID de perfil; la búsqueda exacta valida el"
" identificador de ejecución de 16 caracteres y puede incluir un período "
"esperado. Los ejecutores reciben puertos explícitos vinculados al perfil,"
" verifican que el perfil solicitado coincida tanto con el contexto de "
"operación como con el resultado de la factoría, cargan por identificador "
"exacto de ejecución y comprueban identidad almacenada y coherencia de "
"período antes de proyectar. La ruta de listado valida cada registro "
"canónico antes de crear una proyección pública de inventario. "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`) "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:26
msgid ""
"Receipt projectors require the expected operation definition and subject,"
" success, no side effect, and no refusal detail before exposing the "
"public result. The exact-run registration binds a request with an "
"explicit expected period to selected-period access; omitting the period "
"requires whole-profile access. Run inventory always requires period-"
"independent admission, which is appropriate for disclosing a complete "
"cross-period list. On initial submission/start, the resolver rechecks the"
" exact run in current profile storage; admission replay verifies the "
"stored admission scope and does not retarget a request to a newly "
"selected profile or run. Result subjects are run-specific for exact reads"
" and profile-specific for inventory. run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Los proyectores de recibos exigen definición y sujeto esperados de "
"operación, éxito, ausencia de efectos secundarios y de detalles de "
"rechazo antes de exponer el resultado público. El registro de lectura "
"exacta vincula una solicitud con período esperado explícito al acceso al "
"período seleccionado; omitir el período exige acceso a todo el perfil. El"
" inventario de ejecuciones siempre exige admisión independiente del "
"período, adecuada para divulgar una lista completa entre períodos. En el "
"envío e inicio iniciales, el resolvedor vuelve a comprobar la ejecución "
"exacta en el almacenamiento actual del perfil; la reproducción de "
"admisión verifica el ámbito almacenado de admisión y no redirige la "
"solicitud a un perfil o ejecución recién seleccionados. Los sujetos de "
"resultados son específicos de la ejecución para lecturas exactas y del "
"perfil para inventarios. run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`) "
"run_read_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_operation.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:28
msgid ""
"The `WorkflowRunReader` protocol exposes exact load and newest-first "
"listing, while its factory is keyed by an immutable bucket ID and "
"promises no fallback bucket. That makes the storage choice explicit at "
"the interface boundary. Whether a concrete adapter enforces bucket "
"isolation and encrypted-at-rest handling is outside this chunk. "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`) "
"run_read_ports.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`)"
msgstr ""
"El protocolo `WorkflowRunReader` expone carga exacta y listado de más "
"reciente a más antiguo, mientras que su factoría se indexa por un "
"identificador inmutable de depósito y promete no utilizar un depósito "
"alternativo. Esto hace explícita la elección de almacenamiento en el "
"límite de interfaz. Queda fuera de este bloque si un adaptador concreto "
"impone aislamiento entre depósitos y cifrado en reposo. run_read_ports.py"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`) run_read_ports.py"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/run_read_ports.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:30
msgid "Operator workflow state and assessment"
msgstr "Estado del flujo del operador y evaluación"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:32
msgid ""
"`WorkflowState` documents an encrypted single-envelope persistence model "
"and defines auth state, invoice and ledger review annotations, bucket "
"events, and update time. Its convenience method resolves the active "
"profile within a bundled authority operation; active bucket selection "
"follows the shared selector/capsule logic and returns no bucket for a "
"selector without a current capsule. The type warns callers not to report "
"every unresolved profile as “missing”: locked and genuinely absent "
"records must remain distinguishable through the richer resolver. The "
"encryption and committed-capsule behavior are architectural documentation"
" here, not demonstrated by the model itself. state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`WorkflowState` documenta un modelo de persistencia cifrada en un único "
"sobre y define estado de autenticación, anotaciones de revisión de "
"facturas y libro contable, eventos del depósito y hora de actualización. "
"Su método de conveniencia resuelve el perfil activo dentro de una "
"operación de autoridad incluida; la selección del depósito activo sigue "
"la lógica compartida de selector y cápsula y no devuelve depósito para un"
" selector sin cápsula actual. El tipo advierte a quienes llaman de que no"
" informen de todo perfil sin resolver como «ausente»: los registros "
"bloqueados y los realmente ausentes deben seguir distinguiéndose mediante"
" el resolvedor más completo. El cifrado y el comportamiento de cápsulas "
"confirmadas son aquí documentación arquitectónica, no algo demostrado por"
" el propio modelo. state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`) state_models.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/state_models.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/110-workflow-results-snapshots-and-history-disclosure.md:34
msgid ""
"The strongest properties are strict typed terminal records, cross-field "
"consistency checks, a privacy-conscious snapshot boundary, exact identity"
" checks, and period-aware authorization for read operations. Follow-up "
"review should inspect the production access-registration and persistence "
"adapters to confirm their policy bindings and bucket enforcement, and "
"check whether the 16-character derived identifier meets the project’s "
"correlation and collision requirements. This chunk contains no tests or "
"live storage implementation, so those deployment properties remain "
"unverified."
msgstr ""
"Las propiedades más sólidas son registros finales estrictos y tipados, "
"comprobaciones de coherencia entre campos, un límite de instantáneas "
"atento a la privacidad, comprobaciones exactas de identidad y "
"autorización consciente de períodos para operaciones de lectura. La "
"revisión posterior debe inspeccionar los adaptadores de producción de "
"registro de acceso y persistencia para confirmar sus vinculaciones de "
"políticas e imposición de depósitos y comprobar si el identificador "
"derivado de 16 caracteres cumple los requisitos de correlación y "
"colisiones del proyecto. Este bloque no contiene pruebas ni "
"implementación activa de almacenamiento, por lo que esas propiedades de "
"despliegue siguen sin verificarse."

